/* Generated, not written: Inter 4.001 (SIL Open Font License 1.1, packages/kit/src/client/fonts/Inter-OFL.txt), the face Lumen
   is set in, as the share card draws it (shareCardDraw.ts). satori reads TrueType, OpenType and WOFF but not the
   WOFF2 the client ships, nor a variable font's axes, so these are the client's own packages/kit/src/client/fonts/inter-latin.woff2
   pinned at weights 400 and 700 and written as WOFF, with fontTools:
     instantiateVariableFont(TTFont('inter-latin.woff2'), {'wght': 400}), STAT/MVAR/HVAR/gasp dropped, flavor 'woff'.
   Held here as base64 so the faces travel inside dist/ with the module that reads them: nothing is fetched or read
   from disk when a card is drawn. */

